✅ Q6 — Convert Strings to Uppercase

🎗️ 6.1 Problem Statement

You are given a List<String> containing lowercase, uppercase, and mixed-case strings.
Using Java Streams, convert every string to uppercase.

Your solution should:

👉 Use the Stream API.
🔴 Preserve the original encounter order.
🔴 Return the result as a List<String>.
🔴 Correctly handle duplicate strings.
🔴 Correctly handle an empty list.
🔴 Do not modify the original list.

🎗️ 6.2 Input / Output

👉 Input : ["john", "Alice", "bob", "JOHN", "pRiYa"]
👉 Expected Output : ["JOHN", "ALICE", "BOB", "JOHN", "PRIYA"]

Because:
john  → JOHN
Alice → ALICE
bob   → BOB
JOHN  → JOHN
pRiYa → PRIYA

🎗️ 6.3 Your Task

Write the Java Stream solution.
You can provide:

🔴 Your primary Stream approach.
🔴 Any alternative Stream-based approaches only.
🔴 Empty-list handling.
🔴 Time and space complexity, if you want to attempt them.